2024-11-02 GregTheMadMonk <yagreg7@gmail.com>
    * Rebase to upstream 0542d9f (0.15.0-dev)
    * Disable Wayland when building
    * PSA: If you've used `env -u WAYLAND_DISPLAY` to run this: don't. Just use
